{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國女團少女時代成員Yoon A，近日忙於趕拍改編同名日劇的 tvN 新劇《UNNATURAL》。她在社交網上載新相，透露拍攝時收到餐車應援，她大晒一枱美食，還大讚留言：「全都是我喜歡的菜單。」 昨日(26日)，她又現身首爾龍山區出席服裝品牌活動。她穿上暖笠笠的絨毛外套，對鏡頭擺出可愛甫士又大派飛吻，充滿少女味。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:44:22.373475+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T16:01:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143409+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:37:36.209778+00:00","content_hash":"d45f0c9f44b6b800c599db783367dafcd7b140e70019349cb69632771c5bb6eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:44:22.373475+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}